{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38530","headline":"赴职西川过便桥书怀寄同年 · 吴融","name":"赴职西川过便桥书怀寄同年","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平门桥下水东驰，万里从军一望时。\n乡思旋生芳草见，客愁何限夕阳知。\n秦陵无树烟犹鏁，汉苑空墙浪欲吹。\n不是伤春爱回首，杏坛恩重马迟迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}